{"unit_id": "tag:03DT:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>为拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。设<MATH_0004>。在（<REF_0001>）中定义的函子（functor）对于任意<MATH_0005>-覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>均满足层条件（sheaf condition），这里覆盖的是<MATH_0008>上的任意概形（scheme）<MATH_0007>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "层条件所在概形，待决。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的", "context": "模层性质，待决。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结构层上的模，待决。"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子", "context": "所定义函子，待决。"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指定拓扑的覆盖，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf condition", "target_term": "层条件", "context": "函子所满足条件，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03DT:proof", "translation": "对于<MATH_0001>，<MATH_0002>-覆盖（covering）也是 fpqc-覆盖（covering），见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003>、<REF_0004>及<REF_0005>的结果。因此只须对 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering）证明该定理。假设<MATH_0003>为 fpqc 覆盖（fpqc covering），其中已给定<MATH_0004>。假设有截面（sections）族<MATH_0005>，满足<MATH_0006>。我们须找到对应的截面（section）<MATH_0007>。可将<MATH_0008>重新理解为映射（maps）族<MATH_0009>，它们与典范的（canonical）下降（descent）数据（data）相容，这些数据相伴于拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaves）<MATH_0010>与<MATH_0011>，定义在<MATH_0012>上。因此，由命题<REF_0006>，可见能将它们（唯一地）下降（descend）为映射（map）<MATH_0013>，从而得到所需的截面（section）<MATH_0014>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "descend", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "指定拓扑的覆盖，待决。"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "fpqc covering", "target_term": "覆盖", "context": "fpqc 拓扑下的覆盖，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sections", "target_term": "截面", "context": "相容截面族，待决。"}, {"source_term": "section", "target_term": "截面", "context": "下降后所得截面，待决。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "重解释截面所得映射，待决。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "由原层诱导的数据，待决。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降