{"unit_id": "tag:03DU:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>。设<MATH_0002>为概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0003>为包含<MATH_0004>的大（big）景（site）。设<MATH_0005>为拟凝聚的（quasi-coherent）<MATH_0006>-模（module）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <TEXTITOPEN_0001>大景的结构层（structure sheaf of the big site），该景为<MATH_0007><TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，是环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0008>，记为<MATH_0009>或<MATH_0010>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0011>或<MATH_0012>，则<TEXTITOPEN_0002>小景的结构层（structure sheaf of the small site）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>（该景为<MATH_0013>或<MATH_0014>）是环层（sheaf of rings）<MATH_0015>，记为<MATH_0016>或<MATH_0017>。\n<STRUCT_0004> <TEXTITOPEN_0003>层（sheaf），由<MATH_0018>-相伴模（modules associated）构成，并相伴于<MATH_0019><TEXTITCLOSE_0003>，定义在大（big）景（site）<MATH_0020>上，是<MATH_0021>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0022>，记为<MATH_0023>（常简记为<MATH_0024>）。\n<STRUCT_0005> 若<MATH_0025>或<MATH_0026>，则<TEXTITOPEN_0004>层（sheaf），由<MATH_0027>-相伴模（modules associated）构成，并相伴于<MATH_0028><TEXTITCLOSE_0004>，定义在小（small）景（site）<MATH_0029>或<MATH_0030>上，是<MATH_0031>-模（modules）的层（sheaf）<MATH_0032>，记为<MATH_0033>（常简记为<MATH_0034>）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚的"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf of the big site", "target_term": "大景的结构层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf of the small site", "target_term": "小景的结构层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf of rings", "target_term": "环层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules associated", "target_term": "相伴模"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules associated", "target_te