{"unit_id": "tag:03DR:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，我们在每种情形都使用同一记号（notation）<MATH_0001>。这实际上不会引起混淆，因为按定义，定义层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>的规则与所选考察的景（site）无关。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "notation", "target_term": "记号", "context": "各景使用同一记号，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "所定义的层，待决。"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景", "context": "所选的景，待决。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:03FG:statement", "translation": "在《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0001>中，我们已看到，小 Zariski 景（small Zariski site），对于概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>而言，等价（equivalent）于作为拓扑空间（topological space）的<MATH_0002>，其含义是层（sheaves）的范畴（categories）自然等价（equivalent）。如今<MATH_0003>也配备了结构层（structure sheaf）<MATH_0004>，因而可见，环景（ringed site）<MATH_0005>上的模（modules）层（sheaves）与环空间（ringed space）<MATH_0006>上的模（modules）层（sheaves）一致。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "环景"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "ringed space", "target_term": "环空间"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑", "context": "引用章名，待决。"}, {"source_term": "small Zariski site", "target_term": "景", "context": "概形的小 Zariski 景，中文限定词在前，待决。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "小景的底概形，待决。"}, {"source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价", "context": "层范畴的等价，待决。"}, {"source_term": "topological space", "target_term": "拓扑空间", "context": "概形底空间，待决。"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层", "context": "层范畴与模层，待决。"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "层范畴，待决。"}, {"source_term": "structure sheaf", "target_term": "结构层", "context": "小景的环结构，待决。"}, {"source_term": "ringed site", "target_term": "环景", "context": "带结构层的小景，待决。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "tar