{"unit_id": "tag:070R:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）。景（sites）的每个态射（morphisms）<MATH_0002>，列于《拓扑（Topologies）》第<REF_0001>节，都成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）。具体地，这些景（sites）的态射（morphisms）<MATH_0003>或<MATH_0004>都由连续的（continuous）函子（functor）<MATH_0005>给出。因此，给定<MATH_0006>，令<MATH_0007>为通常的映射（map）<MATH_0008>。类似地，态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，对于<MATH_0010>，见《拓扑（Topologies）》引理<REF_0002>及<REF_0003>，成为环拓扑斯态射（morphism of ringed topoi），因为<MATH_0011>。下面是一些特殊情形：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 大（big）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0012>成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0013>，如《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义<REF_0004>所述。大（big）句法平坦（syntomic）、光滑（smooth）、平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）及 Zariski 景（sites）也类似。\n<STRUCT_0003> 小（small）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0014>成为带环结构的（ringed）景（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，如《景上的模（Modules on Sites）》定义<REF_0005>所述。小 Zariski 景（small Zariski site）也类似。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "allowed_english": ["Zariski"], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "ringed", "target_term": "带环结构的"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "continuous", "target_term": "连续的"}, {"source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Topologies", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "morphism of ringed topoi", "target_term": "环拓扑斯态射"}, {"source_term": "big", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "ringed", "target_term": "带环结构的"}, {"source_term": "sites", "target_t